{
  "name": "Learnify \u2013 05 Google Drive RAG Ingest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2a8158d9-cf2c-4fe4-bc2c-dccdc4a73e13",
      "name": "Pipeline Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udcc1 Google Drive RAG Ingest Pipeline\n\n**Trigger:** Fires when a new PDF is added to the watched Drive folder.\n\n**File naming convention (important):**\n`WAEC_Mathematics_Algebra.pdf`\n\u2192 curriculumType=WAEC, subject=Mathematics, topic=Algebra\n\n**What it does:**\nDownloads PDF \u2192 extracts text \u2192 chunks (900 chars / 150 overlap)\n\u2192 embeds each chunk via Gemini \u2192 saves to backend /api/rag/chunks\n\n**Env vars needed:**\n- `GOOGLE_PALM_API` credential\n- Google Drive credential\n- `backendUrl` in Set Config node\n- Set the Drive folder ID in `Google Drive Trigger` node",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID_HERE",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a4dcb94-65b0-4273-a2f6-4e0ec7bb26c2",
      "name": "Google Drive Trigger - New Curriculum File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "85926c5f-2607-43bd-b883-28dcdcf45907",
              "name": "backendUrl",
              "value": "https://your-backend-url.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6e110276-3cf9-4595-84f4-3fec98e76c64",
      "name": "Set Config - Drive RAG Ingest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        510,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": "={{ $('Google Drive Trigger - New Curriculum File').item.json.id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cbd80599-175c-486f-9e6d-6a93a2b0ab62",
      "name": "Google Drive - Download Curriculum File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a975abea-eba6-44fa-a2bb-d9957cdb40b7",
      "name": "Extract From File - PDF Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1010,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const driveFile = $('Google Drive Trigger - New Curriculum File').item.json;\nconst extracted = $input.first().json;\nconst text = extracted.text || extracted.data || extracted.content || '';\n\nconst fileName = driveFile.name || 'Curriculum File';\nconst cleanName = fileName.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/, '');\n\n// Recommended file naming: WAEC_Mathematics_Algebra.pdf\nconst parts = cleanName.split(/[_-]/).map((p) => p.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    curriculumType: parts[0] || 'WAEC',\n    subject: parts[1] || 'General',\n    topic: parts.slice(2).join(' ') || cleanName,\n    level: '',\n    sourceName: fileName,\n    sourceFileId: driveFile.id,\n    sourceMimeType: driveFile.mimeType,\n    sourceText: text\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "5f5616aa-dd0f-4c9c-8ac8-c253caba45dc",
      "name": "Code - Extract Curriculum Metadata",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json;\nif (!body.sourceText) throw new Error('No text extracted from the Google Drive file. For now, upload PDF files or adjust Extract From File operation for DOCX/TXT.');\n\nconst text = String(body.sourceText)\n  .replace(/\\r/g, '')\n  .replace(/\\n{3,}/g, '\\n\\n')\n  .replace(/[ \\t]{2,}/g, ' ')\n  .trim();\n\nconst chunkSize = 900;\nconst overlap = 150;\nconst chunks = [];\nlet start = 0;\nlet index = 0;\n\nwhile (start < text.length) {\n  const end = Math.min(start + chunkSize, text.length);\n  const chunkText = text.slice(start, end).trim();\n\n  if (chunkText.length > 50) {\n    chunks.push({\n      json: {\n        curriculumType: body.curriculumType,\n        subject: body.subject,\n        topic: body.topic,\n        level: body.level,\n        sourceName: body.sourceName,\n        sourceFileId: body.sourceFileId,\n        sourceMimeType: body.sourceMimeType,\n        chunkIndex: index,\n        chunkText\n      }\n    });\n    index++;\n  }\n\n  start += chunkSize - overlap;\n}\n\nreturn chunks;"
      },
      "id": "b6edba08-4392-41fc-8cf7-70e756ada3f9",
      "name": "Code - Split Curriculum Chunks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1510,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/text-embedding-004:embedContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'models/text-embedding-004', content: { parts: [{ text: $json.chunkText }] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2415d987-1eb7-457f-9a1d-c42037c3f4d9",
      "name": "Gemini Credential - Embed Curriculum Chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const source = $('Code - Split Curriculum Chunks').item.json;\nconst embedding = $input.first().json.embedding?.values || [];\nif (!embedding.length) throw new Error('No embedding returned from Gemini.');\nreturn [{ json: { ...source, embedding } }];"
      },
      "id": "06fa6bf1-f53f-4b61-8454-43ff32472fee",
      "name": "Code - Prepare RAG Chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2010,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Set Config - Drive RAG Ingest').item.json.backendUrl + '/api/rag/chunks' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6b298660-8b6a-4e21-93f6-72e32a80a5ef",
      "name": "Backend - Save RAG Chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2260,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
